WEBVTT

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:06.150
Well, Ha-chan... 
I'm going home for today.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.030
Yeah. Sorry.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:19.870
What is this power?

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:24.330
What am I supposed to do?

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:29.050
When I use magic, I get so hungry, 
I can't think about anything.

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:31.760
Even standing up is a hassle.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:33.990
I can't be like that...

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:36.220
I know I can't be like that, but...

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:38.850
Hatori?

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:43.170
What are you doing over here?

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:44.600
Do you feel sick?

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:46.060
Can you stand?

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.790
You're so kind, Mom.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:50.570
Hatori?

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:52.940
Which "Mom" are you right now?

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.610
What are you talking about?

00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:56.910
I'm your mom.

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.620
What's wrong with you, Hatori?

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:05.480
What do I do, Mom?

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:06.700
I...

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:07.880
What?

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:09.370
It's all right.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:11.710
Your mom is right here.

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:13.970
No, Mom...

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:16.040
I'm not...

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.080
<i>For failing to follow her orders,</i>

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:26.520
<i>the little girl became an evil witch.</i>

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:31.610
<i>And then, she was burned at the stake.</i>

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:09.960
<b>Where the Cheshire Cat Smiles</b>

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:16.500
U-Um...

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.770
I really think we should help...

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:21.210
Oh, no, don't worry about it.

00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:23.000
You're our guests.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:24.820
Just have a seat and wait.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:40.710
Zoroku...

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:44.370
Zoroku!

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:47.340
You guys, where... Where's Zoroku?

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:49.200
Oh, you're up, Sana?

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:51.160
What's wrong?

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:53.110
You're all right?

00:03:53.110 --> 00:03:55.170
You won't go all weird again?

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.830
You're back to normal?

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:58.700
Something really did happen, then?

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:10.010
Zoroku!

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:24.910
Okay, I'm off.

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:26.870
If anything happens, call me!

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:29.110
Even if nothing happens, call me!

00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:30.650
All right, all right.

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:34.790
I'll be home late, so if anything 
happens, you guys call me, too.

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.880
B-Be well!

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:37.840
Okay.

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:42.490
Well, it's cold. 
Let's hurry back inside.

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:43.560
Yeah...

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:45.760
Huh? Why are you two here?

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:46.460
Why?

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:47.550
Unreal!

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:51.530
They waited for you to wake up

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:53.980
because they were worried about you.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:56.780
I was worried, too.

00:04:56.780 --> 00:04:57.890
Is that true?

00:04:57.890 --> 00:04:58.880
W-Well...

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:02.390
Coming all this way, only to 
leave, would be a waste!

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:03.860
Oh, Onee-sama!

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.990
Okay, I'll start cooking right away.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:10.530
Why don't you girls take a bath, 
and then relax a bit?

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:11.650
Okay.

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:12.510
Huh?!

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:14.230
Sa-chan, you take baths?

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:15.920
Wh-Why are you surprised?

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:18.620
Because you never took them before!

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:22.250
W-Well, these days, I do... sometimes.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.500
Wow!

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:26.040
Your voices were in perfect sync!

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:31.920
Lately, Sana-chan likes using 
bath additives, you see.

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:32.910
Huh...

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:35.680
She says the bubbly stuff 
feels really nice.

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:36.810
Huh...

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:40.020
And she likes hot spring 
bath salts, too.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:41.100
Her favorite is—

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:42.120
Hey!

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:43.780
When do you two want your bath?

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:46.650
Want one after we eat or before?

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:48.100
Oh, either one's fine.

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:50.370
We normally take ours together.

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:52.080
Oh?

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:54.140
Well, that's fine, too.

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:56.590
I-Idiot! You didn't have 
to tell her that!

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:57.520
Huh?

00:05:57.520 --> 00:06:01.100
Hey, why are they talking 
about taking a bath?

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:03.520
Well, you see,

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:06.760
Grandpa told them to stay over tonight.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:07.680
Stay over?

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:09.590
Oh, they're sleeping here?

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:10.800
That's right.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.550
Wow! Really?

00:06:16.550 --> 00:06:18.050
Yes, really.

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:24.210
Okay, Sana-chan, show them 
where the towels are!

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:24.780
Sure!

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:26.840
I'm in charge of the towels, you know!

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:27.880
Every day!

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:30.620
Oh, want some juice? 
Or there's milk, too!

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:32.950
When you drink, you put 
one hand on your waist!

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:34.740
You have to, or it's wrong!

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:41.250
Sa-chan is actually washing herself...

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:43.510
And without using her power.

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:44.850
Of course!

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:47.380
You're supposed to wash yourself 
before getting in the bath.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:50.150
If you don't, there's more bacteria!

00:06:53.630 --> 00:06:55.250
Get in up to your shoulders,

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:57.830
and don't get out until 
you count to 100.

00:06:57.830 --> 00:06:59.990
It's a crow's quick bath!

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:02.350
What's a "crow's quick bath"?

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:06.440
A crow's quick bath is a 
crow taking a quick bath!

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:11.570
You have to dry it thoroughly, 
or you'll get sick!

00:07:15.270 --> 00:07:18.540
You three, dinner's ready!

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:23.420
Let's eat!

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:26.690
Thanks for the meal!

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:27.460
That was fast!

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:28.920
<b>Today's Chores!!</b>

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:28.920
<b>Sanae     |    Sana-chan    |    Grandpa</b>

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:28.920
<b>

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:28.920
<b>

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:28.920
<b>

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.380
<b>Kashimura Sana</b>

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:39.570
Sa-chan is washing dishes...

00:07:39.570 --> 00:07:41.450
Not only that...

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:43.020
She takes care of the flowers,

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:46.720
and does laundry and takes out 
the trash when it's her turn.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:48.190
Wow...

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:52.140
There.

00:07:52.140 --> 00:07:54.490
Hello, Grandpa?

00:07:55.150 --> 00:07:56.730
Okay, got it.

00:07:56.730 --> 00:07:58.200
Is that Zoroku?

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.240
Yep, everything is fine.

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:02.340
Hey, what's Zoroku saying?

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:04.000
Just a second.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.080
I'll pass the phone to Sana-chan.

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:06.670
Here.

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:08.250
Hi, Zoroku?

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:10.710
Yeah, much better!

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:13.430
No, we aren't fighting at all!

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:15.540
It's true! I'm not lying!

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:17.340
I haven't used my power, either!

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:19.310
I ate lots at dinner.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.390
And I'll brush my teeth before bed!

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:24.620
It's too small!

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:26.730
The futons won't all fit in here!

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:28.570
Are we really gonna sleep together?

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:32.160
Well, they said we could, right?

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:36.450
You two, it's late already. 
We need to be quiet.

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:38.860
Oh, it's fine. It's just a little fun.

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:41.200
It isn't fine!

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:43.880
Hey, you guys switched places.

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:44.600
Huh?

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:45.670
What do you mean?

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:47.380
Huh?

00:08:53.020 --> 00:08:54.040
S-Stop!

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:55.860
Time to get you back, for what you always do!

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:56.980
Whoops...

00:08:58.060 --> 00:08:59.660
Sa-chan, right here!

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:01.150
What?

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:02.180
What's going on?

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:03.430
Come on... Hurry up!

00:09:03.760 --> 00:09:05.310
No! Not there!

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:07.860
I don't get it, but I'm 
gonna do it, too!

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.330
There! Take that!

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.570
Shh.

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:19.210
R-Right.

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:26.870
<i>Oh, gosh, that's so nice!</i>

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.170
<i>Twins, huh? Sisters, huh?</i>

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:31.680
I wish I could've joined in!

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:37.050
Zoroku's late...

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:40.300
G-Guess being a florist is hard work.

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:52.480
Usually...

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:55.610
Well, sometimes. Or maybe not.

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:59.820
Today... But because of that girl...

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:03.720
We don't remember anything about it.

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:06.750
A Dream of Alice that 
can freeze people...

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:08.710
Were you scared?

00:10:09.430 --> 00:10:10.810
Scared...

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:14.650
Yeah. I was really scared.

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:18.080
Everyone stopped moving. Only I could.

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:19.630
Then, I wonder...

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:21.380
...if she wasn't scared, as well.

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:23.180
She's...

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:26.010
She's evil.

00:10:26.010 --> 00:10:27.640
I'll never forgive her!

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:31.010
She made weird things 
happen to you, too.

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:35.390
Since you guys were coming over today,

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:38.810
Zoroku was supposed to 
get off work early.

00:10:40.350 --> 00:10:42.540
It's all her fault.

00:10:43.170 --> 00:10:45.830
She makes me feel all frazzled!

00:10:58.510 --> 00:10:59.500
Zoroku...

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:02.950
Oh? You're still awake?

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:04.800
I was asleep, but I woke up.

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:07.670
Hey, cut that out.

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:09.580
Are you done for today?

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:10.850
You won't go anywhere else?

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:14.820
No, I'm not going anywhere.

00:11:16.180 --> 00:11:18.250
Hey, don't cling like that.

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:20.280
You'll get the cigarette smell on you,

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:21.560
and Sanae'll get mad.

00:11:21.560 --> 00:11:22.560
No!

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.140
All right, all right...

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:30.410
I'll take a bath. Let go, 
just for a bit.

00:11:30.900 --> 00:11:32.640
Are your friends asleep already?

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:34.840
Zoroku...

00:11:35.890 --> 00:11:37.800
Don't go anywhere else...

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:40.570
Don't turn all weird again.

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:43.580
All right already.

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:45.420
Come on, move...

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:52.600
I never would've imagined 
Sa-chan acting like that.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:53.440
Yeah.

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:03.360
<b>Guide to Seasonal Flowers</b>

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:23.800
Thank you for having us.

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:26.050
Come visit again, sometime.

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:27.120
We will!

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:30.960
Asahi! Yonaga! See you later!

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:32.600
Come stay over again.

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:33.730
Promise you will!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:35.140
All right!

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:37.460
Well, I should go, too.

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:38.280
Huh?

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:40.650
Aren't you off today?

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:44.590
I have to redo all the arrangements 
that went bad yesterday.

00:12:45.230 --> 00:12:46.450
I'll be home early.

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:53.090
It must be rough for Grandpa...

00:13:00.730 --> 00:13:02.030
It's her fault.

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:04.380
I'm gonna get her good.

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:14.430
<b>Shikishima</b>

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:14.430
Welcome.

00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:17.440
Um, is Ha-chan here?

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:19.170
She's upstairs.

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:26.700
Here you go.

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:28.700
Th-Thank you.

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:32.530
Well, take your time.

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:36.240
Thanks, Mom.

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:48.060
Ha-chan, why haven't 
you been at school?

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:51.250
I won't be going to school anymore.

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:54.160
Sorry.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:56.140
But you know it's for the best.

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:57.620
No, it isn't.

00:13:57.620 --> 00:13:59.550
Why are you apologizing?

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:01.610
None of this is your fault!

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:06.880
The police have come by several times.

00:14:08.060 --> 00:14:09.930
But I sent them away.

00:14:10.670 --> 00:14:14.260
I'm a witch, so no one can 
do anything to me.

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:17.080
I'm an evil witch.

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:21.790
Ayu-chan, I'm sorry.

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:24.210
I won't be running away, after all.

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:29.920
I realized that I need to stay 
with my mom and dad.

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:33.790
I didn't tell you before,

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:37.100
but they'd been fighting 
for a long time.

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:38.720
Because of me.

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:42.230
Because I couldn't live up 
to Mom's expectations.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:48.190
When I use my magic, 
they're like they were.

00:14:52.390 --> 00:14:56.490
But once the magic wears off, 
they go back to fighting.

00:14:58.060 --> 00:15:01.460
So I have to stay with them forever.

00:15:04.270 --> 00:15:07.040
Even if it's all a lie, I don't care.

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:15.260
<b>Pedestrians and Bicycles Only</b>

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:17.470
<b>Harajuku Station</b>

00:15:20.900 --> 00:15:22.070
<i>Why?</i>

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:25.000
<i>I know this can't be right.</i>

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:29.100
<i>I don't want to accept that 
there's nothing I can do...</i>

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:31.570
<b>Pedestrians and Bicycles Only</b>

00:15:32.550 --> 00:15:35.220
<i>I won't accept it!</i>

00:15:41.010 --> 00:15:42.000
I'm back.

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:44.000
Welcome home.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:45.220
Welcome back!

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:52.850
What's she doing?

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:57.010
I have no idea, but she's 
been at it all day.

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:04.310
Just watch me, you guys...

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:09.190
<b>Shikishima</b>

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:16.670
Shikishima Hatori, age 9, third grade.

00:16:16.670 --> 00:16:19.550
An only child, living with her parents.

00:16:19.550 --> 00:16:24.170
Harajuku security cameras made 
it easy to identify her, but...

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:25.050
<i>Yes?</i>

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:27.840
This is Yamada. We spoke 
on the phone earlier.

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.090
<i>I'm sorry?</i>

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:34.050
Would you be Shikishima 
Hatori-chan's mother?

00:16:34.650 --> 00:16:38.290
<i>I'd like to speak with you 
concerning Hatori-chan.</i>

00:16:39.990 --> 00:16:42.840
<i>Is Hatori-chan at home right now?</i>

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:47.030
U-Um...

00:16:47.030 --> 00:16:48.040
<i>What is this?</i>

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:50.130
<i>Do you want something 
from my daughter?</i>

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:52.280
Uh, no, just to talk about...

00:16:57.960 --> 00:17:00.520
Well, that's over.

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:04.730
Time to head back, Yamada.

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:06.170
Yeah.

00:17:06.780 --> 00:17:07.590
Wait.

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:09.770
What's "over"?

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:10.550
Huh?

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:13.800
Well, it was... you know, that thing.

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:15.890
Oh, well.

00:17:15.890 --> 00:17:18.520
Let's go eat! I'm starving!

00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:21.540
Huh? I don't want beef bowls again.

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:24.690
You should be more considerate 
toward women.

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:25.880
Toward women!

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:27.150
What do you mean?

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:33.420
Why did you suddenly stop? 
That scared me!

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:38.920
Yamada, we've been had.

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:40.300
This is the fifth time.

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:48.750
Damn...

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:50.500
That girl's really something.

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:58.470
The only people who can go near 
her house are those she allows.

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:00.630
The power to control others.

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:02.450
Then it's true.

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:06.360
If she'd only let us talk to her,

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:08.190
<b>Miho Ayumu</b>

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:08.960
we might be able to help her

00:18:08.960 --> 00:18:13.110
with her problem, 
at least a little bit...

00:18:13.470 --> 00:18:14.980
<i>That girl the other day</i>

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:19.030
<i>used magic just like Ha-chan's.</i>

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:33.490
<i>If I can see that girl again, maybe I 
can figure something out.</i>

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:39.940
<i>Ha-chan's magic hadn't ever been 
broken, but that day, it was.</i>

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:42.140
<i>What is this magic?</i>

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:44.190
<i>Can she never get rid of it?</i>

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:47.040
<i>If I can find that girl, I'm sure...</i>

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:49.910
Sorry, Ayu-chan.

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:52.280
Please don't ever come back.

00:18:52.280 --> 00:18:53.520
Ha-chan!

00:18:53.920 --> 00:18:57.480
I might end up hurting you.

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:00.200
B-But I don't care!

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:02.510
Because... Because you're—

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:03.950
Did you know, Ayu-chan?

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:08.510
If a bear comes down from the 
mountains and attacks someone,

00:19:09.240 --> 00:19:12.050
it can never be returned 
to the mountains.

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:14.630
It's killed.

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:20.220
When I was little, I used to wonder why 
people would do something so cruel.

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:22.340
But now I understand.

00:19:23.490 --> 00:19:25.850
Because it's the same with me.

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:29.130
I can't be among people anymore.

00:19:31.860 --> 00:19:35.370
So I'm sorry, but please 
don't come again.

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:40.970
<i>I won't accept that, Ha-chan!</i>

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:47.160
Hmm? A foreign girl?

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:50.020
Saying she's blonde doesn't help much...

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:52.000
Why? Are you searching for someone?

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:55.040
There are lots of people 
like that around here...

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:56.340
I see.

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:57.340
Sorry.

00:19:59.280 --> 00:20:01.440
Maybe this won't work, after all.

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:06.100
Too many people are here, and I 
don't even know her name.

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:08.220
Wow, that looks good!

00:20:08.570 --> 00:20:10.180
Okay, I'll have the usual.

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:11.060
Really?

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:14.020
<i>The shop we went to.</i>

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:24.250
What we did there last time was wrong.

00:21:05.870 --> 00:21:07.780
Ow...

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:09.280
Wait.

00:21:09.670 --> 00:21:12.430
I-It doesn't hurt...

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:16.010
Where am I?

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:23.880
<i>Huh? Wh-What is this?</i>

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:25.470
<i>Where did that hole go?</i>

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:30.060
I finally found you!

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:30.850
Huh?

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:55.080
You evil, frazzling meanie,

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:56.710
I'm gonna teach you a lesson!

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.930
Next Episode 
The Little Queen

00:23:36.550 --> 00:23:38.140
The Little Queen.
